Value Filldown LOCAL_INTERFACE (\S+)
Value Required CHASSIS_ID (\S+)
Value PORT_ID (.+?)
Value SYSTEM_NAME (.+?)
Value SYSTEM_DESC (.+?)
Value PORT_DESC (.+?)
Value MGMT_ADDRESS (\d+\.\d+\.\d+\.\d+)

Start
  ^Local Port .+ has \d+ neighbor -> Continue.Record
  ^Local Port ${LOCAL_INTERFACE} has \d+ neighbor
  ^Neighbor Index -> Continue.Record
  ^Chassis ID\s+:\s+${CHASSIS_ID}\s*$$
  ^Port ID\s+:\s+${PORT_ID}\s*$$
  ^System Name\s+:\s+${SYSTEM_NAME}\s*$$
  ^System Description\s+:\s+${SYSTEM_DESC}\s*$$
  ^Port Description\s+:\s+${PORT_DESC}\s*$$
  ^Management Address\s+:\s+${MGMT_ADDRESS}\s*$$
